    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when a command is run by a non-player, early in the command handling process. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>You should not use this except for a few cases like logging commands, blocking commands on certain places, or applying modifiers.</para>
<para><bold>The command message contains a slash &apos;/&apos; at the start</bold> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
